Third-party projects

  sf64                 https://github.com/sonicdcer/sf64
                       The Star Fox 64 decompilation (CC0). Its sources are
                       the game code built here.
  sf64-dc              https://github.com/jnmartin84/sf64-dc
                       jnmartin84's Dreamcast port (CC0), which this
                       repository is: its game code, renderer, audio
                       encoder and tools, with the Xbox port's changes
                       marked XBOX:.
  Torch                https://github.com/HarbourMasters/Torch
                       The asset extractor (MIT). Not committed here:
                       setup.py fetches it into tools/Torch at the revision
                       it pins (TORCH_REV), and its CMake build downloads
                       its own libraries (libgfxd, GSL, yaml-cpp, spdlog,
                       tinyxml2), each under its own license.
  Starship             https://github.com/HarbourMasters/Starship
                       The PC port (CC0). The options menu's fixes, cutscene
                       timings, cheats, enhancements and restorations follow
                       its code, and its beta boost-gauge needle art is
                       converted into Platform/xbox/xbox_beta_gauge.h.
  KallistiOS           https://github.com/KallistiOS/KallistiOS
                       The Dreamcast OS. Platform/xbox/ reimplements the part
                       of its API the game uses, with KOS's own names, types,
                       constants and struct layouts, and carries code ported
                       from KOS itself, which stays under the KOS License
                       (Platform/xbox/LICENSE.KOS):
                         dc/sound/aica_comm.h (copied unchanged),
                         aica_cmd_iface.h and aica.h
                           (sound/arm/aica_cmd_iface.h, aica.h),
                         aica/aica_fw_xbox.c (sound/arm/main.c, aica.c),
                         aica/aica_bus_xbox.c (sound/snd_mem.c, snd_iface.c),
                         kos_snd_stream_xbox.c (sound/snd_stream.c),
                         kos_vmu_pkg.c (util/vmu_pkg.c),
                         pvr_xbox.c: the texture twiddle
                           (hardware/pvr/pvr_texture.c) and the polygon
                           header compiler (hardware/pvr/pvr_prim.c).
  RXDK                 Team Resurgent's original-Xbox development kit: the
                       toolchain, SDK and Visual Studio integration the
                       build uses. Installed separately, not part of this
                       repository.

